@@text Jars: `mods/` as of 2026-10-25 23:59 (Creative Common 1.1.03, CD 23:49, Vintage -06, Incubation Additions 1.1.0, repackedStorage
@@text -01), COPIED into the scratch `mods/`. KubeJS tree of 2026-10-26 00:06 plus the fixes below. 3 boots of qb1, 1 of nb1.
@@text New probe: `tools/cdb_en_probe/cdb_en_probe.js` (`/cbetest blocks|soils|growth|dragon|anvil|squid|jars|all`; needs
@@text `forceload add 400 400`). Probe fixes: `fdtest` resolves `creativeengineering:` ids to their `creativedelight:` twin (listed
@@text once), `vtdtest` checks Pickled Sea Pickle instead of Brewin's pickled pickles, `/zq recipes` counts past its 80-line print cap.
@@text Setup slips worth knowing: `/cdjtest` takes no argument and needs `forceload add 400 400` (0 gristle otherwise); `place
@@text structure` needs the spot forceloaded first ("That position is not loaded").
@@text
@@text Fixes made in the run:
@@text
@@text 1. **Boot stopped (datapack load):** `creativedelight:wild/chorus_succulent` used feature type
@@text    `ends_delight:chorus_succulent_feature` (from upstream's stale json); the registered id is `ends_delight:chorus_succulent`.
@@text    Fixed in the configured feature and `tools/gen_crop_worldgen_table.py`. Unreleased work, no changelog bullet.
@@text 2. `sample_syringe.js#71` `redeclaration of var $WorldRows` (Rhino nested `const`, also in the user's client log): the Sample
@@text    Syringe JEI world rows were never added. `const` -> `let`; after a restart the class loads with no warning. Bullet added.
@@text 3. 29 soups had no jar fluid (Miner's cups and bowls, Hostile, Oceanic, End's, Fungi): `gen_soup_soft_fluids.py` only read
@@text    top-level `mods/*.jar`, so the nested CD members and the `*_upstream` donors gave no texture. It now opens jarjar jars and
@@text    donor jars; rerun wrote 29 new fluids (bell pepper soup color now from Rustic 1.7.0). `/fdtest soupjar` PASS after a
@@text    restart (Moonlight reads soft fluids at world load). Bullet added.
@@text 4. `Item.of(i.<tag key>, n)` as a recipe input collapses to the tag's first item (Cake Base wanted 2 Parrot Eggs and plain
@@text    Sugar). 16 grid recipes, 3 Create mixes and 3 IE blueprints fixed: repeated keys for `R.shapeless` / `R.createMixing`,
@@text    `{ id, count }` for `ieBlueprint`; the 4 auto ids that changed are pinned to the old ones. Memory `kubejs-api-notes`. Bullets added.
@@text 5. Vintage's fermented spider eye jar recipe took plain sugar only (`replaceInput` does not reach `vintagedelight:fermenting`):
@@text    replaced by `creativedelight:pickling/fermented_spider_eye_from_fermenting` on the plain sweetener tag. Covered by the
@@text    existing sweetener bullet.
