@@text ### 2026-10-25 late run (group A, current 1.1.03 tree, partial)
@@text
@@text Jars: everything in `mods/` as of 22:13 (copied into the scratch `mods/`, not symlinked: a parallel session rebuilt
@@text and installed Creative Common and CD mid-boot once, `NoClassDefFoundError` in RegisterEvent), Creative Common and CD from
@@text `build/libs` with the fixes below. KubeJS tree of 22:24. One superflat world (qa1), 5 boots. New scratch tools:
@@text `tools/scratch_query/zq_probe.js` (`/zq recipes|rdetail|itemtag|blocktag|tagsof|nbt`), `zq_batch.sh` (a file of
@@text console commands, prints the `[zq]` lines), `game_jvms.sh` (java pids that are not Gradle: `pgrep -x java` also
@@text matches the Gradle daemon). `/dumpall` 22/24 ok (climatecaves, servermods fail on superflat). Server stopped at the end.
@@text
@@text Fixes made in the run (all in unreleased 1.1.03 work, so no changelog bullet):
@@text
@@text 1. Boot stopped in KubeJS startup: CD `moredelight/toast.js` called `FoodBuilder.fast()`; KubeJS 1902 has
@@text    `fastToEat()`. Fixed (CD rebuild).
@@text 2. Boot stopped again: KubeJS counts upper-case asset file names as startup errors. Renamed
@@text    `corn_delight_art_NOTICE.txt` / `more_delight_art_NOTICE.txt` to `_notice.txt` (docs updated). Keep asset names lower case.
@@text 3. `[NCH] withNamespace failed ... redeclaration of var incBbqStick`: the whole CD Farmer's Delight block after the
@@text    barbecue stick was skipped (grilled salmon, rolls, rice medley, mutton chops assemblies...). Nested `const inc*` ->
@@text    `let` in `farmersdelight/recipes.js`, `create/golden.js`, `quarkdelight/recipes.js` (memory `rhino-fieldandmethods-gotcha`).
@@text    After `/reload` the FD sequenced assemblies load.
@@text 4. CD Berserker's Brew came out as a plain water bottle: NCH `vdPickling` wrote results through `_itemJson` (no NBT),
@@text    and `_nbtItemJson` read NBT with `getTag()`, which KubeJS hides from scripts (`.nbt` works). `vdPickling` output and
@@text    secondary now use `_nbtItemJson`, which reads `.nbt`. Verified: Strength, Resistance, Wither. No `ieBlueprint` call
@@text    passes an NBT stack, so that helper's recipes are unchanged. Creative Common rebuild + restart.
@@text
@@text Probe updates (expectations that went stale with the CD move, not pack bugs): `fungi_probe.js` grid / pot meal ids are
@@text `creativedelight:`, colony Serene Seasons checks dropped (FD's colonies are in neither tag; fungi_delight.md corrected);
@@text `vintage_probe.js` resolves a `creativeengineering:` id to its `creativedelight:` twin, jar bottom side is 3 slots (the
@@text -04 remainder slot), roasted pepper tag holds all 9 colors, Berserker's Brew under `creativedelight:pickling/`.
