@@text
@@text Fixes made in the run (pack and jar):
@@text
@@text 1. `R.replaceInput` / `R.replaceOutput` (NCH) take `includeAdded`: KubeJS 1902.6 swaps only recipes loaded from data,
@@text    never script-added ones. Item merges pass it (`[itemMerges] 2 swaps in script-added recipes`: the two Canned Coffee
@@text    Berries recipes). Opt-in because a swap replaces the whole matching slot (sugar -> `#forge:sugar` turned a
@@text    `[sugar, honey]` slot into the tag alone when it ran on added recipes).
@@text 2. `item_merges.js`: Respite's kettle has no KubeJS schema, so gambler's tea is removed and rebuilt with `R.frBrewing`
@@text    on Rustic's beans. `mortar.js` skips catalog entries naming a purged item (`[mortar] 6 of 7`).
@@text 3. `tool_effects.js` and `sample_syringe.js`: `event.getSource().getEntity()` threw (KubeJS name `getActual()`), so no
@@text    on-hit tool effect and no syringe hit sample ever happened.
@@text 4. `trades.js`: MoreJS 0.3.0 reads `[1, 5]` as level 1 only (both ends from the first entry); every level range is a
@@text    real `IntRange(1, 5)` now, so the cleric, chef and engineer removals and the Canned Food filter reach levels 2 to 5.
@@text 5. Creative Common `StemExtraFruit`: grows only the stem's own fruit (Delightful's slices and cantaloupe extend the vanilla
@@text    blocks and report the vanilla stem; re-pointing only knew the real fruit).
@@text 6. Creative Common `OceanGeodes.untouched` checks the alternate inner layer too (Geode Plus' prismarine geode keeps its
@@text    budding prismarine there; the inner layer is plain prismarine).
@@text 7. `jeed_providers.js` skips Xaero's map effects when the mod is not loaded (12 `[NCH] jeedProvider failed` errors on
@@text    every dedicated server boot).
@@text 8. `tools/build_deploy.py`: runtime rules for `mortar_catalog.json` and `placed_food_slices.json` (the release
@@text    preflight refused to build without them). New `tools/changelog_test/scratch_deploy_build.py` runs the release
@@text    build into a scratch folder (SQ-OM-17).
@@text
@@text Probe fixes (all in `tools/`): `food_drinks_probe.js` (fills Moonlight's map, clears jar spots), `gear_misc_probe.js`
@@text (pillagers for shields, `attack`, dimension key, game-profile id, sack NBT), `farm_worldgen_probe.js` (real stem fruits,
@@text prismarine by alternate layer, only blocks a placement added, reach check against the floor, new `zfw rivertrees R`),
@@text `older_food_probe.js` (inedible count, grid type ids, can recipes not meals, quiche reassembly, purged keys, butcher
@@text trades from real villagers), `older_misc_probe.js` (enchant copy, `attack`, Xaero skip, Unlit Campfire statics, `let`).
