@group A
@commands Fenced 9x9 pasture with a survival bot inside and 2 cows; the bot places a Rock Salt Block (`salt:raw_rock_salt_block`) at one end and a Salt Dust Block (`salt:salt_block`) at the other; `time set 1000`, `/cdevtest tickwarp 12000` (10 minutes), state of both blocks
@pass the placed block reads `hearthandharvest:placed_rock_salt_block` right after placing; after the warp it is `lightly_licked`, `well_licked` or `heavily_licked` (a cow wore it); the Salt Dust Block is still `salt:salt_block`; latest.log has no "Salt lick POI clash" line
@fails no wear: POI not built on the placed block (`HHSaltRegistry.PLACED_ROCK_SALT`) or no cow reached it (record the cow positions from `cdevtest entities`); placed block stays `salt:raw_rock_salt_block`: `SaltEvents.afterPlace` / `BlockPlaceLickMixin` not applied; Salt Dust Block worn: old lick root
@reviewed 2026-11-26
