## SQ-SALT2-11 | Rock Salt refills one stage by hand and by dispenser; salt dust and salt layers do not
@group A
@commands A `heavily_licked_salt_block`: right click with salt dust, then with `vintagedelight:salt` (layer item); another heavily licked: Rock Salt (`salt:raw_rock_salt`) three times; a dispenser with salt dust and one with Rock Salt facing a `well_licked_salt_block`; a `waxed_heavily_licked_salt_block` + Rock Salt by hand; a placed Rock Salt Block (full) + Rock Salt by hand
@pass salt dust leaves the lick `heavily_licked`; the layer item puts `vintagedelight:salt[layers=1]` on top and the lick stays; Rock Salt: heavily -> well -> lightly -> `placed_rock_salt_block`, 1 used each; dispenser with salt dust: lick stays well; dispenser with Rock Salt: well -> lightly; waxed heavily -> `waxed_well_licked_salt_block`; full block: state unchanged and the Rock Salt count unchanged
@fails salt dust refills: `SaltLick.isSalt` still on `#forge:salt`; layer merged into the lick: `LickableSaltBlock.neighborChanged` still present; full block uses a Rock Salt: `SaltLick.restored` null check
