@group any
@commands `/cdevtest rdetail` for `creativedelight:shaped/rock_salt_block`, `creativedelight:shapeless/rock_salt_from_block`, `creativedelight:createmixing/rock_salt_water_salt`, `creativedelight:shaped/large_salt_lamp`; `recipes` text checks for the removed `salt:raw_rock_salt`, `salt:raw_rock_salt_block` and `creativedelight:createmixing/water_salt`. The live heated basin (Create mixer, blaze burner, kinetics) is not driven: the mixing is checked at recipe level and by a LOOK
@pass Rock Salt Block = 4 Rock Salt (2x2); the block back to 4 Rock Salt; the mixing takes the block and 1000 mB water and gives the block back plus 2 salt dust; Large Salt Lamp = 7 Rock Salt, glowstone block, wooden slab; no `water_salt` recipe and no upstream `salt:raw_rock_salt*` recipe
@fails water turns to salt alone: old `water_salt` still loaded; upstream recipes not removed: `creativedelight/salt.js` (R.remove ids)
@reviewed 2026-11-26
# r1126q: ids checked against kubejs/exported/recipes (2026-11-19 dump); the mixing's heat is not printed by rdetail
> cdevtest rdetail creativedelight:shaped/rock_salt_block
> cdevtest rdetail creativedelight:shapeless/rock_salt_from_block
> cdevtest rdetail creativedelight:createmixing/rock_salt_water_salt
> cdevtest rdetail creativedelight:shaped/large_salt_lamp
> cdevtest recipes createmixing/water_salt
> cdevtest recipes salt:raw_rock_salt
