expect verb=rdetail id=creativedelight:shapeless/rock_salt_from_block serializer=\S+ result=salt:raw_rock_salt\*4
expect verb=rdetail id=creativedelight:createmixing/rock_salt_water_salt serializer=create:mixing\b
expect verb=rdetail id=creativedelight:createmixing/rock_salt_water_salt part=fluids value=in:\S*minecraft:water\S*@1000mB
expect verb=rdetail id=creativedelight:createmixing/rock_salt_water_salt part=results value=\S*vintagedelight:salt_dust\*2@1
expect verb=rdetail id=creativedelight:shaped/large_salt_lamp serializer=\S+ result=\S+salt_lamp\S*\*1
expect verb=recipes text=createmixing/water_salt n=0
reject verb=recipes id=salt:raw_rock_salt(_block)?\s
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=rdetail .*done=0
look rdetail of the lamp lists 7 Rock Salt, 1 glowstone block and a wooden slab in its stepN or fields lines; the mixing result keeps the block (first output) and adds 2 salt dust; heat needs JEI (heated) or the owner

