## SQ-SALT2-15 | Salt Melt stacks to 16 unused; a use from a stack splits one off
@group A
@commands `/cdevtest item salt:salt_melt`; a survival bot gets 20 Salt Melts (`give`), right clicks `minecraft:ice` once with the 16 stack, then the inventory; `give` the bot 2 damaged (`{Damage:1}`) and 1 unused Salt Melt after clearing
@pass max_stack=16; the 20 arrive as 16 + 4; after the use the held stack is 15 and one Salt Melt with `Damage:1` is elsewhere in the inventory; the ice is water; damaged ones take one slot each and never stack with the unused
@fails 20 stacks of 1: `getMaxStackSize(ItemStack)` not called; whole stack damaged: split missing (`SaltMeltItem.useOn`)
@reviewed 2026-11-26
# r1126q: "63/64" of the old text is Damage:1 of 64 uses
> forceload add 5490 5490 5520 5520
sleep 3
> cdevtest item salt:salt_melt
> pbot spawn sm15 5500.5 -60 5506.5 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 3
> pbot inv sm15 clear
> give sm15 salt:salt_melt 20
> pbot inv sm15 get
> pbot inv sm15 select 0
> setblock 5500 -61 5500 minecraft:ice
> cdevtest use 5500 -61 5500 as=sm15 face=up
> cdevtest state 5500 -61 5500
> pbot inv sm15 get
> pbot inv sm15 clear
> give sm15 salt:salt_melt{Damage:1} 2
> give sm15 salt:salt_melt 1
> pbot inv sm15 get
> pbot remove sm15
expect verb=item item=salt:salt_melt .*max_stack=16\b
expect verb=pbot.inv bot=sm15 slot=\d+ item=salt:salt_melt\*16
expect verb=pbot.inv bot=sm15 slot=\d+ item=salt:salt_melt\*4
expect verb=use main=salt:salt_melt\*15\b.*state="?minecraft:water
expect verb=pbot.inv bot=sm15 slot=\d+ item=salt:salt_melt\*15
expect verb=pbot.inv bot=sm15 slot=\d+ item=salt:salt_melt\*1\{Damage:1\}
count verb=pbot.inv bot=sm15 slot=\d+ item=salt:salt_melt\*1\{Damage:1\} == 3
reject verb=pbot.inv bot=sm15 slot=\d+ item=salt:salt_melt\*2\{Damage
reject verb=pbot\.\S+ .*error=
reject \[cdevtest\] .*done=0

